{
  "title": "Gemini Review Spend",
  "uid": "gemini-review-spend",
  "tags": ["gen-ai", "gemini", "review", "cost"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_VM",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "github_repository",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VM}"},
        "query": "label_values(gen_ai_client_token_usage_total, github_repository)",
        "regex": "",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {"text": "All", "value": "$__all"}
      },
      {
        "name": "gen_ai_request_model",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VM}"},
        "query": "label_values(gen_ai_client_token_usage_total{github_repository=~\"$github_repository\"}, gen_ai_request_model)",
        "regex": "",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {"text": "All", "value": "$__all"}
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": {"from": "now-30d", "to": "now"},
  "timepicker": {},
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Monthly spend (USD, 30d rolling)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VM}"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "gen_ai_review_cost_usd:monthly{github_repository=~\"$github_repository\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$gen_ai_request_model\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{github_repository}} / {{gen_ai_request_model}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false},
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green", "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 16},
              {"color": "orange", "value": 20},
              {"color": "red", "value": 50}
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Tokens by type",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VM}"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (gen_ai_token_type) (rate(gen_ai_client_token_usage_total{github_repository=~\"$github_repository\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$gen_ai_request_model\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{gen_ai_token_type}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "stacking": {"mode": "normal", "group": "A"},
            "fillOpacity": 40,
            "lineWidth": 1
          },
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["sum"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Per-review latency (p50 / p95)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VM}"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, gen_ai_request_model) (rate(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds_bucket{github_repository=~\"$github_repository\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$gen_ai_request_model\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{gen_ai_request_model}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, gen_ai_request_model) (rate(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds_bucket{github_repository=~\"$github_repository\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$gen_ai_request_model\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{gen_ai_request_model}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2},
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom"},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Cost per review (USD)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VM}"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "quantile(0.50, gen_ai_review_cost_usd:per_run{github_repository=~\"$github_repository\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$gen_ai_request_model\"})",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "quantile(0.95, gen_ai_review_cost_usd:per_run{github_repository=~\"$github_repository\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$gen_ai_request_model\"})",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2},
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 4
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom"},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Pricing table age (days since as_of)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VM}"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 14},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "gen_ai_pricing_table_age_days",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]},
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "d",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green", "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 90},
              {"color": "orange", "value": 180}
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Notes — finding classification panels deferred",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Panels deferred to phase-44:**\n\n- Finding-count by classification (substantive/nit/stylistic/noise)\n- Finding-count by severity\n\nBoth require the VictoriaLogs log-fan-out in the Alloy sidecar + parsing of the `<!-- chalupa-findings ... -->` JSON block from review bodies. See `workstreams/chalupa-brain/prompts/phase-44-reusable-telemetry-sidecar.md`.\n\n**AI5 (30-PR stylistic-ratio validation)** pins to `reference_review_cost_baseline_YYYY_MM` once those panels land."
      }
    }
  ]
}
